3. Koko Eating bananas:

Link: https://leetcode.com/problems/koko-eating-bananas/description/


Code:

class Solution {
    public int totalhours(int[]arr, int hrs)
    {
        int totalhours = 0;
        for(int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++){
            totalhours += Math.ceil((double)arr[i]/(double)hrs);
        }
        return totalhours;
    }
    public int minEatingSpeed(int[] piles, int h) {
        int low = 1;
        int high = 0;
        int ans =0;
        for(int n: piles){
            high = Math.max(n,high);
        }
        while(low<=high){
            int mid = (low+high)/2;
            int totalhours = totalhours(piles,mid);
            if(totalhours<=h){
                high = mid-1;
            }
            else{
                low=mid+1;
            }
        }
        return low;
    }
}


Time Complexity: O(n × log(max(piles)))
Space Complexity: O(1)
